-- Source module: Solutions.J6SegTab
/-!
# Segmented inverse (S2): construction of the constant tables

`mkTables P R s t α` (computable) fills the tables of `J6SegAlg` with
* `di u = expNeg P s (α²(t-s)u²)` (`≈ 2^P e^{-πα²θu²}`),
* `dd u = expPos (P+R) s (α²(t-s)u²) R` (`≈ 2^P e^{πα²θu²}`, needs `e^{πα²θu²} ≤ 2^R`),
* `gam`: `(q;q)_u` by the recurrence `Γ_{u+1} = Γ_u (1 - q^{u+1})` (`q^k` by `expNeg`),
* `gi u = 2^P / Γ_u` (`fdiv`), `ap/am c h = (-1)^h e^{-πα²(σ ± 2β_c)h} / Γ_h`,
* `cpl i h = expNeg P s² (α² K_{i,h})` (the entries of `E`, as in `Eapprox`).

`mkTables_ok`: `TabOK` with `E = 3λ + 3` and `Dm = D_{λ-1}`, for blocks of length `≤ λ`, as soon as
`200 (3λ+1) ≤ 2^P` and `D_{λ-1} ≤ 2^R`.
-/

